**Test filters.** For this step these gates run only the tests their filter selects (plus any inherited expected-red tests); put the tests this step adds or changes where a filter value finds them:
- `constructor-unit-tests`: 

**How to implement.** The name an experiment is stored under, and the kit's template writing it from the experiment's setup (001 §A 'A file that exists many times is named by its own identity … plus its kind extension'; 001 §J 'It names setups and experiments'; the S9.1 brief: experiments are named by the kit's naming template (S8.3) and stored as `<name>.experiment-json`; the S8.3 mapper's request: a one-way member from `NameText`, never both, ELEV006). Nothing stores a name before step 290. Each doc is one to three lines citing spec 0050 S9.1. (1) `OpticalConstructor.Domain/Experiments.fs`. (a) `ExperimentError` (`Experiments.fs:ExperimentError`) moves to directly after step 285's types, its two cases kept, and gains `InvalidExperimentNameErr of reason : string` (a blank name) and `member this.describe : string`, rendering `the experiment is unknown: <reason>`, `the experiment is unavailable: <reason>` and `the experiment name is not valid: <reason>`; a match over the error anywhere gains the case. (b) `ExperimentName of string` with `.value`: `static member tryCreate (text : string) : Result<ExperimentName, ExperimentError>` keeps the text as given and refuses an empty or white-space text with `InvalidExperimentNameErr`; `member this.fileStem : FileStem` is `FileStem.ofText this.value` (step 24), so a name keeps the lab's characters (.spec-md §3.11); `member this.nextFreeAmong (taken : ExperimentName list) : ExperimentName` is the `ExperimentName` of `FileStem.firstFreeText this.value` over the taken names' `fileStem`s (step 255), the one suffix sequence items and setups use. (c) `ExperimentId` gains `member this.defaultName : ExperimentName`, `E<n>`: the name an experiment takes when the template cannot name its setup, which is the stem step 146 gives it today, so every such experiment keeps its file name. (2) `OpticalConstructor.Domain/NamingTemplates.fs`, after step 271's members: (a) `type NameText with member this.toExperimentName : Result<ExperimentName, ExperimentError>`, `ExperimentName.tryCreate` of its text; no member converts back (ELEV006). (b) `type NamingTemplate with member this.experimentNameAmong (slots : SetupSlot list) (items : Item list) (noteOpt : NamePart option) (taken : ExperimentName list) (unnamed : ExperimentName) : ExperimentName`: `writeName` of `nameReadingOf slots items noteOpt` (steps 269, 271), made an `ExperimentName` by `toExperimentName` and free among `taken` by `nextFreeAmong`, or `unnamed` when the template cannot name the slots; it calls those members as `setupNameAmong` does (step 271), so no second naming rule exists. No other member, cache or option is added. Tests. `ExperimentProxyTests` gains `an experiment name keeps its text, refuses a blank one, takes the next free suffix and defaults to its id`: `ExperimentName.tryCreate "CPL-(QZ#45-LR#45)-CPL"` keeps the text and its `fileStem` is `FileStem "CPL-(QZ#45-LR#45)-CPL"`; `"a: b/c"` has `FileStem "a_ b_c"`; `""` and `"   "` answer `InvalidExperimentNameErr`; `(ExperimentName "X").nextFreeAmong [ ExperimentName "x"; ExperimentName "X (2)" ]` is `X (3)` and among `[]` `X`; and `(ExperimentId 7).defaultName` is `ExperimentName "E7"`; and `every experiment error renders its condition and its payload`: each case over a distinct test-local reason renders a distinct text holding it. `NamingTemplateTests` (steps 268-271) gains `an experiment is named by the kit's template from its setup's slots, made free among the kit's experiments, or takes the name it is given`: over step 271's slots, items and `lab` template, the full slots among `[]` give `CPL-(QZ#45-LR#45)-CPL`, among `[ ExperimentName "cpl-(qz#45-lr#45)-cpl" ]` give `CPL-(QZ#45-LR#45)-CPL (2)`, with the note `2` give `CPL-(QZ#45-LR#45)-CPL-2`, and with `lpA` holding nothing give the `unnamed` `E3`; and `(NameText "  ").toExperimentName` answers `InvalidExperimentNameErr`.

**Acceptance.** After experiment names land, `ExperimentName` MUST refuse a blank text, take its file stem from the shared name rule and its next free suffix from `FileStem.firstFreeText`, `ExperimentId.defaultName` MUST be `E<n>`, and `NamingTemplate.experimentNameAmong` MUST write the template's name of a setup's slots made free, or answer the name it is given; constructor-unit-tests MUST pass, including `an experiment name keeps its text, refuses a blank one, takes the next free suffix and defaults to its id`, `every experiment error renders its condition and its payload` and `an experiment is named by the kit's template from its setup's slots, made free among the kit's experiments, or takes the name it is given`, the count rising by 3; and build, elevation and the sixteen s29 invariants MUST pass.
